      "authorType": "TOPIC",
      "competitionRanking": 1662,
      "content": "<p>Use dataset_cot.csv for training reasoning during SFT for bit problems. Contains data for all bitwise operations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Nand,And,Or,Xor,Majority,Choice,shift,rotation</li>\n<li>filtered meticulously to contain only correct samples and standardized reasoning format.</li>\n<li>Contains 5000 high quality reasoning traces for SOTA performance\n<a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/luciankucera/bitunit-test-depth-1\" target=\"_blank\">dataset</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/nvidia-nemotron-model-reasoning-challenge/discussion/685886\" target=\"_blank\">prompt</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Now I will work on creating dataset for other problems. And I will no work on RL kaggle environment, for bit problem using SOTA techinques.\nAlso might share highly optimized Unsloth kaggle SFT pipeline for high velocity training, without precision loss. </p>",
      "feedbackTrackingData": {},
      "id": 3431330,
      "isThankYou": false,
      "kernelVersion": 0,
      "parent": {},
      "postDate": "2026-03-29T22:45:03.780Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "Use dataset_cot.csv for training reasoning during SFT for bit problems. Contains data for all bitwise operations:\n* Nand,And,Or,Xor,Majority,Choice,shift,rotation\n* filtered meticulously to contain only correct samples and standardized reasoning format.\n* Contains 5000 high quality reasoning traces for SOTA performance\n[dataset](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/luciankucera/bitunit-test-depth-1)\n[prompt](https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/nvidia-nemotron-model-reasoning-challenge/discussion/685886)\n\nNow I will work on creating dataset for other problems. And I will no work on RL kaggle environment, for bit problem using SOTA techinques.\nAlso might share highly optimized Unsloth kaggle SFT pipeline for high velocity training, without precision loss. ",
